			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1700242">
									

<p>Don't mean to add water to an already overflowing cup, but besides the interview log (which was the only unsettling part of the file for me) the rest was kind of meh; nothing about the description of a small tree drew me in.</p>
<p>Also, I think a few lines of your containment protocols could be reworded. As the procedure stands, it reads as a description of its current confinement, not as a 'how to' for containment. IE, &quot;SCP-1816 is confined in a windowless experimental room measuring 7 x 7 x 4 meters&quot; could instead read &quot;SCP-1816 is to be confined in a windowless experimental room measuring 7 x 7 x 4 meters.&quot;</p>
<p>I like the idea, but pending a more interesting execution, no vote from me.</p>

